    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "This workflow acts as an intelligent, error-safe email processor. It automatically takes an incoming email and uses AI to analyze it, extracting five key details (category, priority, sentiment, department, and summary) into a highly structured format. To prevent errors, the system checks whether the AI successfully populated these critical fields. If the email is too confusing or vague for the AI to understand, a safety fallback branch triggers automatically. This fallback assigns safe, standard default values, ensuring the automation continues running smoothly without crashing your system."
      },
